  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pastel_Shaders/BH_Pastel_Shaders_Header.png\" alt=\"Pastel 光影 Logo\" width=\"1024\" height=\"324\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ffe8e9&amp;labelColor=ffced2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=blue\" width=\"205\" height=\"26\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<em><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/支援-IRIS、OCULUS、OPTIFINE | 1.7 至 1.20-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=CurseForge&amp;labelColor=ffced2\" width=\"385\" height=\"28\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252felocindev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ElocinDev-支持我-ffe8e9?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Ko-Fi&amp;labelColor=ffced2\" width=\"212\" height=\"27\"></a></em><em>&nbsp;</em>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fELOCIN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Pastel_Shaders/BH_Pastel_Shaders_Promo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1018\" height=\"151\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Pastel Shaders 是一款風格化的美學光影包，提供多種色彩預設</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1066006073456197652/presets-transparent.gif\" alt=\"Pastel Shaders 的三種預設展示\" width=\"1200\" height=\"608\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/977751810922131456/1066223943956041748/highperformance.png\" alt=\"Pastel 是一款高效能光影\" width=\"1120\" height=\"567\"></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🎨 多種色彩預設</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\">從粉紅、藍色到黃色調的粉彩調色盤任你選擇！</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>🌌 寧靜的氛圍</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\">接近原版的體驗，搭配清澈的星空。美麗的夕陽與日出。</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>✏️ 高度自訂化</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\">無論新手或進階使用者，自訂簡單且幾乎沒有限制！</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚙️ 友善的使用者設定選單</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\">太多設定讓你不知所措？Pastel 擁有類似多數現代遊戲的快速設定。</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>💻 可在多數現代電腦上運行</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\">專為現代低階 GPU 甚至內建顯示晶片最佳化！</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>☁️ 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/insanity-shader\" rel=\"nofollow\">Insanity 光影包</a> 為兄弟作品</strong></span>\n<p>Pastel 是 Insanity 的相反版本，基於 BSL Shaders ♥！</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
